    "descriptions": [
        "{[G_HRE_NAME]}",
        "Defeat waves of enemies to Unlock and Promote the featured Character!",
        "The {[G_HRE_NAME]} takes place over {[AMOUNT]} days. Amass {[G_HRE_SCORE_POINTS_WITH_ICON]} to ultimately Unlock and Promote the featured Character.\n\nReach {[G_HRE_SCORE_POINTS_WITH_ICON]} milestones to earn {[G_HRE_CURRENCIES_WITH_ICON]} and open event crates containing {[G_HRE_SHARDS_WITH_ICON]} and other rewards.\n\nEach Character's event will come back a number of times and you retain your amassed {[G_HRE_SCORE_POINTS_WITH_ICON]} and progress between events featuring that same Character.\n\nHave fun!"
    ]
